{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MmjofnT8Nskz4QnGkav7p2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\timport Mathlib\n2\t\n3\tstructure PreNecklaces where\n4\t  c : Fin 7 → Fin 2\n5\t  color : ∃ S : Finset (Fin 7), S.card = 4 ∧ ∀ i ∈ S, c i = 0\n6\t  deriving Fintype\n7\t\n8\tdef myDihedralGroup (n : ℕ) : Subgroup (Equiv.Perm (Fin n)) :=\n9\t  Subgroup.closure {finRotate n, Fin.revPerm}\n10\t\n11\tinstance Necklaces.setoid : Setoid PreNecklaces where\n12\t  r n1 n2 := ∃ s ∈ myDihedralGroup 7, n1.c = n2.c ∘ s\n13\t  iseqv :=\n14\t  { refl n := ⟨1, one_mem _, by simp⟩\n15\t    symm := by\n16\t      rintro m n ⟨p, hp, eqp⟩\n17\t      refine ⟨p⁻¹, inv_mem hp, eqp ▸ ?_⟩\n18\t      ext x\n19\t      simp\n20\t    trans := by\n21\t      rintro a b c ⟨p, hp, eqp⟩ ⟨q, hq, eqq⟩\n22\t      refine ⟨q * p, mul_mem hq hp, ?_⟩\n23\t      rw [eqp, eqq]\n24\t      ext x\n25\t      simp }\n26\t\n27\tabbrev Necklaces := Quotient Necklaces.setoid\n28\t\n29\tnoncomputable instance : Fintype Necklaces := by\n30\t  have := Quotient.finite (Necklaces.setoid)\n31\t  exact Fintype.ofFinite Necklaces\n32\t\n33\tnoncomputable abbrev brualdi_ch14_26_solution : ℕ := 15\n34\t\n35\t/--\n36\tHow many different necklaces are there that contain four red and three blue beads?\n37\t-/\n38\ttheorem brualdi_ch14_26 : Fintype.card Necklaces = brualdi_ch14_26_solution := by sorry\n39\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b7cf553-38a9-427f-b22a-2fb3846671f0","uuid":"d377d2fd-5ea3-4351-ab01-f461da80ef47","timestamp":"2026-10-14T02:30:55.163Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/work/combi_brualdi_ch14_26.lean","content":"import Mathlib\n\nstructure PreNecklaces where\n  c : Fin 7 → Fin 2\n  color : ∃ S : Finset (Fin 7), S.card = 4 ∧ ∀ i ∈ S, c i = 0\n  deriving Fintype\n\ndef myDihedralGroup (n : ℕ) : Subgroup (Equiv.Perm (Fin n)) :=\n  Subgroup.closure {finRotate n, Fin.revPerm}\n\ninstance Necklaces.setoid : Setoid PreNecklaces where\n  r n1 n2 := ∃ s ∈ myDihedralGroup 7, n1.c = n2.c ∘ s\n  iseqv :=\n  { refl n := ⟨1, one_mem _, by simp⟩\n    symm := by\n      rintro m n ⟨p, hp, eqp⟩\n      refine ⟨p⁻¹, inv_mem hp, eqp ▸ ?_⟩\n      ext x\n      simp\n    trans := by\n      rintro a b c ⟨p, hp, eqp⟩ ⟨q, hq, eqq⟩\n      refine ⟨q * p, mul_mem hq hp, ?_⟩\n      rw [eqp, eqq]\n      ext x\n      simp }\n\nabbrev Necklaces := Quotient Necklaces.setoid\n\nnoncomputable instance : Fintype Necklaces := by\n  have := Quotient.finite (Necklaces.setoid)\n  exact Fintype.ofFinite Necklaces\n\nnoncomputable abbrev brualdi_ch14_26_solution : ℕ := 15\n\n/--\nHow many different necklaces are there that contain four red and three blue beads?\n-/\ntheorem brualdi_ch14_26 : Fintype.card Necklaces = brualdi_ch14_26_solution := by sorry\n","numLines":39,"startLine":1,"totalLines":39}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MmjofnT8Nskz4QnGkav7p2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
